Few-shot calibration examples:

Example 1:
Project: Internal approval workflow for purchase requests.
Good estimate shape: discovery, data model, authentication and roles, approval flow, notifications, admin reporting, QA, deployment.
Typical risk: unclear approval rules and edge cases around delegation.

Example 2:
Project: Mobile habit tracking app with offline mode and reminders.
Good estimate shape: UX flow, local persistence, sync API, push notifications, analytics, app store release, QA.
Typical risk: offline conflict resolution and notification behavior across platforms.

Example 3:
Project: Data pipeline for daily finance reports.
Good estimate shape: source integration, validation, transformation jobs, monitoring, dashboard export, alerting, handover.
Typical risk: source data quality and late schema changes.
